  - id: Viz_8
    viz_guid: 3af2b13f-82eb-4d06-afa8-dc01e196b40b
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        <h2>Portfolio Insights & Highlights</h2>
        <br>
        <body>This Liveboard provides a comprehensive daily workflow for Relationship Managers. Key highlights include:</body>
        <ul>
        <li><strong>Customer Portfolio</strong> - Monitor total customer base and geographic distribution across states to identify high-value segments.</li>
        <li><strong>Transaction Health</strong> - Track transaction volumes and patterns to spot anomalies and engagement opportunities.</li>
        <li><strong>Loan Portfolio</strong> - Review total loan exposure, pending amounts, and repayment progress by loan type.</li>
        <li><strong>Risk Management</strong> - Average risk scores help prioritize customers needing attention.</li>
        <li><strong>Credit Utilisation</strong> - Monitor credit usage patterns across card types to identify upsell opportunities or credit limit adjustments.</li>
        </ul>
